  "kind": "recipe",
  "metadata": {
    "alignment": "unspecified",
    "description": "NON-COMMERCIAL: the DFlash2 draft model in this recipe is licensed CC BY-NC-ND 4.0 (IncoAI, via r0b0tlab's EXL3 quantization); the target checkpoint and the recipe sources are MIT. Candidate single-Spark vLLM profile from r0b0tlab's glm53-flash-exl3-dflash2-sm121 at 2dfbdbe4: the exact b3194b87 GLM-5.3-Flash EXL3 2.25 bpw checkpoint (98.5 GB, vision tower included), the exact 1be456be DFlash2 EXL3 3.00 bpw draft, TP1, DFlash2 K=5, fused EXL3 MoE kernels, CUDA graphs, fp8 KV, 32K context, reasoning and tool parsing. Upstream ships no container and measured a host-native vLLM v0.30.0rc1 build; this image applies upstream's patches 0007-0012 (0006 skipped, subset of 0009) to the digest-pinned official vLLM v0.30.0 image and builds the plugin's CUDA extension for sm_120/sm_121, so the runtime base differs from the measured one. Upstream claims (not measured here): DFlash2 K=5 single-stream 50.2 tok/s structured, 43.4 code, 19.5 prose. The same checkpoint reaches 256K context only on upstream's separate ExLlamaV3/TabbyAPI runtime, not on this vLLM profile. Physical Spark acceptance is pending.",
